 your Cube by clearing obstacles. \n\nSuitable for all ages.\n\nDesigned for maximum comfort. \n\nPlay alone or with a friend.\n\nGood luck, and long live the Cube! \n\n", "short_description": "A light hearted, deceptively challenging puzzle game. \n\nSupports single player and multiplayer.\n\nCan you lead your Cube to victory?\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.physicagames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.physicagames.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Physica Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.physicagames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE", "CASUAL", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "1208369136553274"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035406_259589186213253_7691158086317235657_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dghTz_yzQ9wQ7kNvwFUoriX&_nc_oc=AdkZtgOQddOrdY5sBSnYLemQV3k-6h5z8_ut1nXEQdrQ4MBEAPZUqNzkuMxCq5Ivc0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx9zg2Uns0z60MtX0mX8ogzLUa1N7jwvVt2uBgSRcnafQ&oe=69BE8078"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Long Live The Cube", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAM